@ApiUrl = https://localhost:7180
@ApiKey = replace-in-non-development

### List active plugin jobs
GET {{ApiUrl}}/api/plugin-jobs
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Simulated report
POST {{ApiUrl}}/api/plugin-jobs/reports/send-report/executions
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"Fire-and-forget","parameters":{"reportName":"Monthly report","recipient":"demo@example.com"}}

### Import after uploading the commandes plugin
POST {{ApiUrl}}/api/plugin-jobs/commandes/import-commandes/executions
X-Hangfire-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"Fire-and-forget","parameters":{"connectionName":"ApplicationConnection"},"batchId":"2a7bb48e-2f81-4bfe-acd3-e084c94588d3"}
